  "source_findings": [
    "rdprail.c:1674-1749 creates initially hidden windows without a title; later window update assigns title/show state.",
    "rdpdisp.c:326-399 translates between client and compositor coordinate spaces; numeric origin difference alone does not establish failure.",
    "weston-rdprail-shell.xml exports focus proxy, not a surface-to-Windows-handle query.",
    "Registered ClientActiveXCore metadata has generic connection/graphics events but this inspected metadata supplies no per-surface RAIL WindowCreate correlation. NoMatchingEventsFound for the existing enabled operational-channel query does not prove RDP health."
  ],
